  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New Democracy Fund 2020-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The New Democracy Fund is a part of DANEP and has the overall goal of strengthening democratically organised civil society in the Neighbourhood region.

The New Democracy Fund will work within several overarching themes: youth, media, culture, labour market, climate and gender equality, and will operate in three tracks:
1) Strengthening of civil society and long-term regional networks between civil society and youth organisations in Denmark and Neighbourhood countries.
2) Rapid response funds for civil society organisations, human rights activists and journalists in urgent need of support.
3) New people-to-people relations through exchange between civil society, culture and education institutions in Denmark and the Neighbourhood countries.</narrative>
  </description>
